### DELIVERY CHALLANS CRUD

# List delivery challans
GET http://localhost:8000/api/delivery-challans/
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>

####
# Create delivery challan (all fields, with file association)
POST http://localhost:8000/api/delivery-challans/
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer_id": 1,
  "challan_number": "DC-2025-001",
  "reference_number": "REF-789",
  "date": "2025-08-30",
  "challan_type": "liquid_gas",
  "item_details": [
    {"item_id": 1, "quantity": 2, "rate": "100.00", "amount": "200.00"},
    {"item_id": 2, "quantity": 1, "rate": "150.00", "amount": "150.00"}
  ],
  "delivery_challan_file_ids": [10, 11],
  "total_amount": "20000.00"
}

####

# Retrieve delivery challan (with nested item details and file association)
GET http://localhost:8000/api/delivery-challans/1/
Authorization: Bearer <access_token>
# Response will include:
#   "delivery_challan_file_ids": [10, 11],
#   "delivery_challan_files": [ {"id": 10, "file": "..."}, ... ]

